---
title: ClearFrame — a finding's life
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> queued : breakdown extracts it

    queued --> researching : worker claims the job
    queued --> held : budget cap reached before dispatch

    researching --> verifying : evidence recorded
    verifying --> researching : challenged, and budget remains
    verifying --> tracing : evidence accepted or exhausted
    tracing --> assessing : chains traced

    assessing --> review : HIGH risk, or any chain unresolved
    assessing --> cleared : LOW risk and every chain clear

    review --> approved : counsel · clear for use
    review --> licensed : counsel · pursue licence
    review --> replaced : counsel · replace element
    review --> rejected : counsel · remove from cut

    cleared --> monitored : watch armed
    approved --> monitored : watch armed
    licensed --> monitored : watch armed
    replaced --> monitored : watch armed
    rejected --> monitored : watch armed

    monitored --> review : a new source conflicts with the record
    monitored --> monitored : no material change

    queued --> withdrawn : absent from a later cut
    withdrawn --> queued : it came back

    held --> researching : POST /resume after the cap is raised
    researching --> failed : three attempts exhausted
    failed --> researching : POST /resume

    note right of monitored
        nothing in the monitoring path
        can close a finding.
        only a person can.
    end note

    note right of review
        the AI cannot mark anything approved.
        requireRole("counsel") is server side.
    end note
